<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<title>一起验湃｜HyperOS 4 Beta 体验报告有奖活动</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #f5f5f5;
  --card-bg: #fff;
  --card-bg-alt: #fafafa;
  --text-primary: #1a1a1a;
  --text-secondary: #666;
  --text-tertiary: #888;
  --text-muted: #999;
  --shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  --tag-bg: #f0eeff;
  --img-bg: #fff;
  --strong-color: #333;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #1a1a1a;
    --card-bg: #2a2a2a;
    --card-bg-alt: #333;
    --text-primary: #e5e5e5;
    --text-secondary: #aaa;
    --text-tertiary: #888;
    --text-muted: #777;
    --shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    --tag-bg: rgba(132,123,238,0.15);
    --img-bg: #2a2a2a;
    --strong-color: #ddd;
  }
}
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Text", "Helvetica Neue", "PingFang SC", "Noto Sans CJK SC", sans-serif;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text-primary);
  line-height: 1.6;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  padding-top: calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px));
}

/* Banner */
.banner {
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 1080 / 240;
  background: url('//static.coolapk.com/static/mobile/assets/banner.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 16px;
}
.banner::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='0.06'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
}
.banner-text {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  color: #fff;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 0 20px;
}
.banner-text h1 {
  font-size: clamp(18px, 5vw, 32px);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
}

/* Container */
.container {
  max-width: 768px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 12px 40px;
}

/* Section */
.section {
  background: var(--card-bg);
  border-radius: 16px;
  margin-top: 16px;
  padding: 20px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

/* Time */
.time-bar {
  text-align: center;
  background: var(--card-bg);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 14px 18px;
  margin-top: 12px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  line-height: 1.8;
}
.time-bar .label { color: var(--text-muted); }
.time-bar .date { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); }

/* Steps hint */
.steps-hint {
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 16px;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--text-tertiary);
  font-weight: 500;
}

/* Step header */
.step-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.step-badge {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #847bee, #9b8fef);
  color: #fff;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.step-title {
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

/* Topic tag */
.topic-tag {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  background: var(--tag-bg);
  color: #847bee;
  padding: 6px 14px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.step-desc {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

/* Prize card */
.prize-group {
  margin-top: 16px;
}
.prize-group-title {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.prize-group-sub {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.prize-card {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
  padding: 12px;
  background: var(--card-bg-alt);
  border-radius: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.prize-img {
  width: 72px;
  height: 72px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: var(--img-bg);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: #bbb;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.prize-img img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
}
.prize-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.prize-name {
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  margin-bottom: 2px;
}
.prize-qty {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #847bee;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* Note */
.prize-note {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-top: 8px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

/* Rules */
.rules-title {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #847bee;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.rules-list {
  list-style: none;
}
.rules-list li {
  position: relative;
  padding-left: 18px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.rules-list li::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 10px;
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #847bee;
}
.rules-list li strong {
  color: var(--strong-color);
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Banner -->
<div class="container">
<div class="banner">
  <div class="banner-text">
    <h1>&nbsp;</h1>
  </div>
</div>

  <!-- Time -->
  <div class="time-bar">
    <div class="label">📅 活动时间</div>
    <div class="date">即日起至 2026年9月14日 23:59</div>
  </div>

  <div class="steps-hint">👇 两种方式轻松参与，双通道赢奖品</div>

  <!-- Step 1 -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="step-header">
      <div class="step-badge">1</div>
      <div class="step-title">📝 发帖分享</div>
    </div>
    <p class="step-desc">在 <span style="display:inline-block;background:#f0eeff;color:#847bee;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:14px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px">#一起验湃#</span> 话题下发布动态/图文/点评/清单，分享真实使用体验</p>

    <div class="prize-group">
      <div class="prize-group-title">🏆 优秀内容奖（评选）</div>
      <div class="prize-group-sub">正向或负向评价不影响评选，谢绝尬吹或尬黑或云评测</div>

      <div class="prize-card">
        <div class="prize-img"><img src="//static.coolapk.com/static/mobile/assets/sound-pro.png" alt="Xiaomi Sound Pro"></div>
        <div class="prize-info">
          <div class="prize-name">Xiaomi Sound Pro</div>
          <div class="prize-qty">× 5</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prize-card">
        <div class="prize-img"><img src="//static.coolapk.com/static/mobile/assets/band11.png" alt="小米手环10 Pro 陶瓷版"></div>
        <div class="prize-info">
          <div class="prize-name">小米手环10 Pro 陶瓷版</div>
          <div class="prize-qty">× 15</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Step 2 -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="step-header">
      <div class="step-badge">2</div>
      <div class="step-title">⭐ 一键打分</div>
    </div>
    <p class="step-desc">在话题页为 HyperOS 4 Beta 打分（分数不计入正式版）</p>

    <div class="prize-group">
      <div class="prize-group-title">🎲 最佳幸运奖（抽奖）</div>
      <div class="prize-group-sub">打分即自动可参与抽奖，无需发帖</div>

      <div class="prize-card">
        <div class="prize-img"><img src="//static.coolapk.com/static/mobile/assets/powerbank.png" alt="小米金沙江磁吸充电宝 45W"></div>
        <div class="prize-info">
          <div class="prize-name">小米金沙江磁吸充电宝 45W</div>
          <div class="prize-qty">× 10</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Rules -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="rules-title">
      <span>⚠️</span> 活动须知（必看）
    </div>
    <ul class="rules-list">
      <li>仅限 <strong>HyperOS 4 Beta 机型用户</strong>参与</li>
      <li>内容须为原创，转发/搬运/水帖不参与评选</li>
      <li>每人最多领取 <strong>2 份</strong>奖品（评优+抽奖各限1份）</li>
      <li>中奖后需 <strong>7天内</strong> 填写收货信息，逾期视为放弃</li>
      <li>话题内禁发交易、推广、引流等无关内容</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
